# Maintrix ships a byte-exact PWA whose assets are pinned by Subresource Integrity
# (index.html) and service-worker precache hashes (sw.js). Any CRLF/LF conversion on
# checkout changes the bytes and breaks those hashes — a wrong SRI hash makes the browser
# block app.js so the app never boots. On a machine with core.autocrlf=true this happened
# silently. Pin every hashed asset so no eol/autocrlf setting can rewrite it.
apps/maintrix/app.js        -text
apps/maintrix/app.css       -text
apps/maintrix/index.html    text eol=lf
apps/maintrix/sw.js         text eol=lf
apps/maintrix/pow-worker.js text eol=lf
apps/maintrix/manifest.json text eol=lf
apps/maintrix/*.png         binary
apps/maintrix/fonts/**      binary
